{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53048","headline":"鲍防《云门寺济公上方偈序》 杜倚《漉水囊偈》 · 浙东衆诗人","name":"鲍防《云门寺济公上方偈序》 杜倚《漉水囊偈》","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"裂素成器，给我救彼。\n密净圆灵，护生絜水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"浙东衆诗人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}